  data: {
    LLM: "Bonuses are worth more than the game. If you have the Skíz, your primary mission is to hunt for your opponent's XXI. If you have the XXI, you MUST avoid being caught by the Skíz.\n\nThe 'Uhu' setup: If you can't save your Pagát for the last trick, try to use it to win the 8th trick (Uhu). This requires very precise card counting to ensure no higher trumps are left.\n\nBidding Signals: Players use advanced bids to signal whether they can support a 'Pagát Ultimó' or if they are vulnerable to a 'XXI-Catch'.",
    Player: "Bonuses are worth more than the game. If you have the Skíz, your primary mission is to hunt for your opponent's XXI. If you have the XXI, you MUST avoid being caught by the Skíz.\n\nThe 'Uhu' setup: If you can't save your Pagát for the last trick, try to use it to win the 8th trick (Uhu). This requires very precise card counting to ensure no higher trumps are left.\n\nBidding Signals: Players use advanced bids to signal whether they can support a 'Pagát Ultimó' or if they are vulnerable to a 'XXI-Catch'.",
